Package: libdatachannel-dev
Section: libdevel
Architecture: any
Multi-Arch: same
Depends:
 libdatachannel0.24 (= ${binary:Version}),
 ${misc:Depends},
Description: WebRTC data channels, media transport and WebSockets (development files)
 libdatachannel is a C/C++ implementation of WebRTC: data channels, media
 transport over DTLS-SRTP with RTP and RTCP handling, and WebSockets. It
 interoperates with browsers, with ICE through libjuice.
 .
 This package contains the C and C++ headers and the CMake package
 configuration.

